'''Sweet Love Mekako''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Valentine Gals (Gacha Event)|Valentine Gals]] event. She was added in [[Version 11.2 Update|Version 11.2]] and is the Valentine's variant of [[Mekako Saionji (Uber Rare Cat)|Mekako Saionji]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 12.1 Update|Version 12.1]] targets [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] enemies instead and gains immunity to [[Immune to Curse|Curse]].

